cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. For the study behind its rules, please also cite the manuscript listed under references."
title: "iHydro Check"
abstract: "A free, private, in-browser checker for hydrologic model inputs and errors (SWAT, SWAT+, MODFLOW, APEX and their couplings). It reads a model folder before a run, matches pasted error messages to known causes, and answers questions from community findings and documentation, showing the evidence behind each answer."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Serrano
    given-names: David
    affiliation: "Texas Tech University"
  - family-names: Park
    given-names: Seonggyu
    affiliation: "Texas Tech University"
date-released: "2026-07-10"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dauresy/check"
url: "https://dauresy.github.io/check/"
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - SWAT
  - SWAT+
  - MODFLOW
  - APEX
  - model validation
# doi: add the Zenodo DOI here once the first release (v0.1.0) is archived
references:
